## 🚀 Quick Start


# 1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/lvercell/Azure-Automations.git  
cd "Azure-Automations/Azure Provisioning with Terraform and Ansible"

# 2. Initialize Terraform
cd terraform  
terraform init  
terraform plan -var-file="lab.tfvars"  
terraform apply -var-file="lab.tfvars"

# 3. Configure Windows VM using Ansible
cd ../ansible  
ansible-playbook -i hosts.ini playbook.yml

